    "answer": {
      "short": "$f(1-x)=x^2-x=f(x)$.\n\nSubstitute $1-x$, expand and collect like terms.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(1-x)&=(1-x)^2-(1-x)\\\\f(1-x)&=1-2x+x^2-1+x\\\\f(1-x)&=x^2-x=f(x).\\end{align*}$$",
